  "title": "23 September 1967: Filming: Magical Mystery Tour",
  "date": "1967-09-23",
  "content": "<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1\"><div class=\"entry-content clear\" itemprop=\"text\"><p>This was the fifth day of filming for Magical Mystery Tour at West Malling Air Station in Maidstone, Kent. <span id=\"more-6498\"></span></p><p>Among the exterior shots filmed during the week at the army base were the marathon scene, which took place on the main runway and perimeter road; another in which a group of people including <a href=\"/people/mal-evans/\">Mal Evans</a> and <a href=\"/people/neil-aspinall/\">Neil Aspinall</a> had their picture taken by Little George the photographer; and a tug of war involving 12 children and blindfolded vicars.</p><p>The most memorable of the exterior shots, however, was for <a href=\"/songs/i-am-the-walrus/\">‘I Am The Walrus’</a>. The Beatles mimed to the song at two locations at the airfield, including use of high anti-blast concrete walls atop which the group and four actors dressed as policemen stood.</p><div data-carousel-extra=\"{&quot;blog_id&quot;:1,&quot;permalink&quot;:&quot;https://www.beatlesbible.com/1967/09/23/filming-magical-mystery-tour-11/&quot;}\" id=\"gallery-1\" class=\"gallery galleryid-6498 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-thumbnail\"><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1967-photos/67-beatles-magical-mystery-tour-i-am-the-walrus_02/\"><img decoding=\"sync\" width=\"200\" height=\"144\" src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/67-beatles-magical-mystery-tour-i-am-the-walrus_02-200x144.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"The Beatles filming I Am The Walrus for Magical Mystery Tour, September 1967\" srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/67-beatles-magical-mystery-tour-i-am-the-walrus_02-200x144.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/67-beatles-magical-mystery-tour-i-am-the-walrus_02-580x416.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/67-beatles-magical-mystery-tour-i-am-the-walrus_02.jpg 720w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"24255\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1967-photos/67-beatles-magical-mystery-tour-i-am-the-walrus_02/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/67-beatles-magical-mystery-tour-i-am-the-walrus_02.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"720,517\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"The Beatles filming I Am The Walrus for Magical Mystery Tour, September 1967\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/67-beatles-magical-mystery-tour-i-am-the-walrus_02.jpg\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></a></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1967-photos/67-beatles-magical-mystery-tour-i-am-the-walrus_04/\"><img decoding=\"sync\" width=\"200\" height=\"130\" src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/67-beatles-magical-mystery-tour-i-am-the-walrus_04-200x130.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"The Beatles filming I Am The Walrus for Magical Mystery Tour, September 1967\" srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/67-beatles-magical-mystery-tour-i-am-the-walrus_04-200x130.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/67-beatles-magical-mystery-tour-i-am-the-walrus_04-580x378.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/67-beatles-magical-mystery-tour-i-am-the-walrus_04-960x626.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/67-beatles-magical-mystery-tour-i-am-the-walrus_04-768x501.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/67-beatles-magical-mystery-tour-i-am-the-walrus_04.jpg 1000w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"24257\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1967-photos/67-beatles-magical-mystery-tour-i-am-the-walrus_04/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/67-beatles-magical-mystery-tour-i-am-the-walrus